  "title": "Applesauce Bran Muffins",
  "description": "Applesauce bran muffins are an easy way to eat bran cereal and are quick and easy to prepare for breakfast or a snack.",
  "authors": [
    "Dottie Worthington"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-03-05T00:12:50-05:00",
